\" data-p=\"r\">儿</span>。","py":"Xiànzài shuōshuo wǒ xué Zhōngwén de lù, wǒ xiànzài zài nǎr.","en":"Now about my Chinese learning journey, and where I stand."},{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">去</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nián\">年</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kāi\">开</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shǐ\">始</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yòng\">用</span>Duolingo，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hěn\">很</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xǐ\">喜</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huan\">欢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hěn\">很</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zūn\">尊</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhòng\">重</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hàn\">汉</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yīn\">因</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wèi\">为</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhí\">直</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiě\">写</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dé\">得</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bù\">不</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hǎo\">好</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kàn\">看</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dé\">德</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yǔ\">语</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yě\">也</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kě\">可</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hòu\">后</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lái\">来</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xǐ\">喜</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huan\">欢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shàng\">上</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"le\">了</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hàn\">汉</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=