 class=\"h\" data-p=\"kè\">课</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fēi\">非</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cháng\">常</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yǒu\">有</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">意</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"sī\">思</span>。","py":"Jīnnián wǒ chóngxīn kāishǐ le: yòng Du Chinese yuèdú, yòng yìdiǎnr Duolingo, hái yòng Anki kǎpiàn. Hòulái wǒ kāishǐ shàng wǎngkè, fēicháng yǒu yìsi.","en":"This year I started again: reading with Du Chinese, a little Duolingo, and Anki flashcards. Then I started online lessons, which is really fun."},{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"méi\">没</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shàng\">上</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"guò\">过</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhèng\">正</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">式</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kè\">课</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"suǒ\">所</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yǐ\">以</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cháng\">常</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cháng\">常</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cuò\">错</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiǎn\">简</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dān\">单</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huà\">话</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yě\">也</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bù\">不</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hǎo\">好</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kě\">可</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kāi\">开</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shǐ\">始</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yòng\">用</span>HSK<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">试</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cè\">测</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">试</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">自</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jǐ\">己</span>：<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xué\">学</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"le\">了</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gè\">个</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bàn\">半</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yuè\">月</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yī\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mó\">模</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">拟</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">试</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"le\">了</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mǎn\">满</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fēn\">分</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"méi\">没</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiǎng\">想</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dào\">到</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"èr\">二</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yě\">也</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"guò\">过</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"le\">了</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"sān\">三</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mó\">模</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">拟</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">试</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gāng\">刚</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gāng\">刚</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">及</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gé\">格</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yīn\">因</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wèi\">为</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dōu\">都</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hàn\">汉</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"tài\">太</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nán\">难</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"le\">了</span>。","py":"Wǒ méi shàngguo zhèngshì de Zhōngwén kè, suǒyǐ wǒ chángcháng shuō cuò, jiǎndān de huà yě shuō bu hǎo. Kěshì wǒ kāishǐ yòng HSK kǎoshì cèshì zìjǐ: xuéle yí ge bàn yuè, yī jí mónǐ kǎoshì wǒ kǎole mǎnfēn. Méi xiǎngdào èr jí yě guò le. Sān jí de mónǐ kǎoshì wǒ gānggāng jígé, yīnwèi dōu shì Hànzì, tài nán le.","en":"I never took a proper Chinese class, so I make many mistakes and can't say simple things well. But I started testing myself with the HSK: after a month and a half I got full marks in the level 1 practice test. To my surprise I passed level 2 too. Level 3 I only just passed, because it is all Hanzi and very hard."},{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiàn\">现</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zài\">在</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zài\">在</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhǔn\">准</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bèi\">备</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"sān\">三</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">试</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shí\">十</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yī\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yuè\">月</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"èr\">二</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shí\">十</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yī\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hào\">号</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shí\">十</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"èr\">二</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yuè\">月</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zài\">再</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cì\">次</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yīn\">因</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wèi\">为</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xīn\">新</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"sān\">三</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gèng\">更</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nán\">难</span>。2027<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nián\">年</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiǎng\">想</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎo\">考</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"sì\">四</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span>。","py":"Xiànzài wǒ zài zhǔnbèi sān jí kǎoshì, shíyī yuè èrshíyī hào kǎo. Shí'èr yuè wǒ zài kǎo yí cì, yīnwèi xīn de sān jí gèng nán. Èr líng èr qī nián wǒ xiǎng kǎo sì jí.","en":"Now I'm preparing for HSK 3; the exam is on 21 November. In December I take it again, because the new HSK 3 is harder. In 2027 I want to take HSK 4."}],"bullets":["2025<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nián\">年</span> · Duolingo · 24<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jí\">级</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hěn\">很</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xǐ\">喜</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huan\">欢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hàn\">汉</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span>：<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hěn\">很</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zūn\">尊</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhòng\">重</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiě\">写</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bù\">不</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hǎo\">好</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kàn\">看</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǚ\">女</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"ér\">儿</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shēng\">生</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"rì\">日</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huà\">画</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shòu\">寿</span>","2026<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nián\">年</span>9<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yuè\">月</span> <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"chóng\">重</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xīn\">新</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kāi\">开</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shǐ\">始</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kǎ\">卡</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"piàn\">片</span> · <span cl